pmc:AlvarTvm0107Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 1.7.11: the decad is said to yield the cure of disease"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 1.7.11: Frucht der Dekade: Die Heilung von Krankheit"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarNoyAruttal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: nōykaḷai ōṭuvikkumē. Bharati: provides a cure for sickness and disease. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will all our ill disband."@en ;
