pmc:AlvarTvm0209Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 2.9.11: the decad is said to yield release"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 2.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Befreiung"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVidu ;
    skos:note "Tamil: keṭalil vīṭu ceyyum kiḷarvārkkē. Bharati: will secure liberation for those who sing it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will unto those that sing them ardently bestow heavenly bliss, from all ills freed."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil gives the fruit to the ardent (kiḷarvārkku)."@en ;
