pmc:AlvarTvm0302Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.2.11: the decad is said to yield release"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.2.11: Frucht der Dekade: Befreiung"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVidu ;
    skos:note "Tamil: uyiriṉ mēl ākkai ūṉiṭai oḻivikkumē. Bharati: will rid the soul of its enveloping flesh. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will rid the chanters of their fleshy shackles."@en ;
