pmc:AlvarTvm0304Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.4.11: the decad is said to yield release and standing with the celestials"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.4.11: Frucht der Dekade: Befreiung und Stand bei den Himmlischen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVidu, pmc:AlvarVanavar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār vīṭil pōkam eyti virumpuvar amarar moyttē. Bharati: provides liberation and the company of celestials. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will the heaven ascend and eternal service enjoy, becoming the celestials' favourites."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
