pmc:AlvarTvm0305Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.5.11: the decad is said to yield the ending of karma"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.5.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Enden des Karma"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVinaiTirtal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: aruviṉai nīṟu ceyyumē. Bharati: those who sing it will win over strong karmas. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will to ashes reduce all sins, however cruel."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 3.5.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0306Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.6.11: the decad is said to yield becoming the lord's devotee"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.6.11: Frucht der Dekade: Zum Verehrer des Herrn werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTamar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: pattarākak kūṭum payilumiṉē. Bharati: learn it and become his devotees. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: learn these songs; you will also become devotees pure."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 3.6.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0307Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.7.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from rebirth"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.7.11: Frucht der Dekade: Nicht wiedergeboren werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPiravaamai ;
