pmc:AlvarTvm0308Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.8.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.8.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
