pmc:AlvarTvm0309Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.9.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from rebirth"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Nicht wiedergeboren werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPiravaamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: collavallārkku illai caṉmamē. Bharati: gives freedom from rebirth to those who can sing it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will from births be freed."@en ;
