    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.10.11: the decad is said to yield release and rule over earth or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 3.10.11: Frucht der Dekade: Befreiung und Herrschaft über Erde oder Himmel"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVidu, pmc:AlvarAlutal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vīṭum peṟuttit taṉ mūvulakukkum tarum oru nāyakamē. Bharati: grants liberation and world sovereignty forever. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will be granted heavenly bliss and made the sole monarch of all his worlds."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 3.10.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0401Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.1.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from affliction"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.1.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freiheit von Leid"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTuyarIlamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: akkāmaṟ kaṟpavar āḻtuyar pōy uyyaṟ pālarē. Bharati: those who learn it shall live free from despair. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will from deep distress be relieved and salvation attain."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.1.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0402Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.2.11: the decad is said to yield standing with the celestials"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.2.11: Frucht der Dekade: Stand bei den Himmlischen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVanavar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallavar malipukaḻ vāṉavarkku āvar naṟ kōvaiyē. Bharati: those who can recite it will be fitting company for celestials. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will on a par be with the celestials in heaven."@en ;
    skos:note "Both translations call the decad the cure for the sickness of separation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.2.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0403Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.3.11: the decad is said to yield rule over earth or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.3.11: Frucht der Dekade: Herrschaft über Erde oder Himmel"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAlutal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallārkaḷ vaiyam maṉṉi vīṟṟiruntu viṇṇum āḷvar. Bharati: those who sing it will rejoice here and rule over heaven. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will for long flourish in this abode and rule as well, right from here, the heavenly abode."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.3.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0404Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.4.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven and the ending of karma"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.4.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels und Das Enden des Karma"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam, pmc:AlvarVinaiTirtal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vaikuntam naṇṇi tolviṉai tīra. Bharati: those who learn it as good words will end misery, enter Vaikuntha. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will of all their sins be cured and attain the blissful heaven."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.4.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0405Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.5.11: the decad is said to yield the ending of karma"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.5.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Enden des Karma"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVinaiTirtal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vēri māṟāta pū mēl iruppāḷ viṉai tīrkkumē. Bharati: by this the lady of unfading lotus will end all despair. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: Lakṣmī will help those that learn these songs to get rid of all sins."@en ;
    skos:note "The agent of the fruit is Lakṣmī and not the lord; Bharati renders viṉai as despair, Satyamurthi as sins."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.5.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0406Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.6.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from affliction"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.6.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freiheit von Leid"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTuyarIlamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: toḻutu āṭip pāṭavallār tukka cīlam ilarkaḷē. Bharati: those who can dance and sing these lines will overcome depression of spirits. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: they will of miseries be rid that recite, adoring and dancing."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil sets the condition of worshipping, dancing and singing."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.6.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0407Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.7.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.7.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: taḻuvap pāṭi āṭa vallār vaikuntam ēṟuvarē. Bharati: those who can sing and dance with love will ascend heaven. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: those that sing with zeal and revel in these songs will the high heavens scale."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.7.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0408Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.8.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from rebirth and reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.8.11: Frucht der Dekade: Nicht wiedergeboren werden und Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPiravaamai, pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vayiram cēr piṟappu aṟuttu vaikuntam naṇṇuvarē. Bharati: those who sing it will cut asunder birth and attain heaven. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will have their chronic cycle of birth and death ended and attain Vaikuntam."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.8.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0409Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.9.11: the decad is said to yield reaching the lord's feet"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen der Füße des Herrn"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTiruvadi ;
    skos:note "Tamil: tiruvaṭiyē aṭaivikkum. Bharati: recited with humility, it will secure the lord's feet. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will lead the chanters on to those very feet."@en ;
    skos:note "Bharati adds a condition of humility that neither the Tamil nor Satyamurthi carries."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.9.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0410Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.10.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 4.10.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār mīṭciyiṉṟi vaikunta mānakar maṟṟatu kaiyatuvē. Bharati: those who recite this have access to the other Vaikuntha, city of no return. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: are assured of the eternal kingdom in heaven."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 4.10.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0501Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.1.11: the decad is said to yield reaching the lord's feet"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.1.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen der Füße des Herrn"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTiruvadi ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ārvaṇṇattāl uraippār aṭikkīḻ pukuvār polintē. Bharati: those who sing it shall rise and attain his lotus feet. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: those that lovingly recite these songs will his feet attain."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil sets the condition of reciting with love (ārvaṇṇattāl)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.1.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0502Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.2.11: the decad is said to yield the cleansing of the heart"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.2.11: Frucht der Dekade: Die Reinigung des Herzens"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarUlamMacuArutal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: uḷḷattai mācu aṟukkumē. Bharati: will cleanse devotees' hearts. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: the hearts of those that recite will be rid of blemishes."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.2.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0503Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.3.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.3.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: uraikkavallārkku vaikuntam ākum tam ūr ellām. Bharati: those who sing it will find Vaikuntha wherever they live. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will heavenly bliss enjoy right at their residence."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.3.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0504Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.4.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.4.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: iṟantupōy vaikuntam cērā āṟu eṅṅaṉē. Bharati: singing this will secure heaven after death. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: how can those that recite fail to enter heaven at the end of their lives."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.4.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0505Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.5.11: the decad is said to yield becoming the lord's devotee"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.5.11: Frucht der Dekade: Zum Verehrer des Herrn werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTamar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: aṟiyak kaṟṟuvallār vaiṭṭaṇavar āḻkaṭal ñālattuḷḷē. Bharati: those who sing with understanding will unite with Vishnu while on earth. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: those that learn well will as chaste Vaiṣṇavas be lauded in this world."@en ;
    skos:note "The translations divide on the fruit: union with Viṣṇu on earth against becoming Vaiṣṇavas in this world; the Tamil vaiṭṭaṇavar supports the second. Both agree on the condition of learning with understanding (aṟiyak kaṟṟu)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.5.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0506Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.6.11: the decad is said to yield service to the lord and his devotees"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.6.11: Frucht der Dekade: Dienst am Herrn und an seinen Verehrern"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAtimai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: tirumāl aṭiyārkaḷaip pūcikka nōṟṟārkaḷē. Bharati: those who can sing it will serve his devotees with great wealth. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will in this world be blest with the huge wealth of devotion unto Tirumal's votaries."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.6.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0507Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.7.11: the decad is said to yield standing with the celestials"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.7.11: Frucht der Dekade: Stand bei den Himmlischen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVanavar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vaikal pāṭavallār vāṉōrkku ārā amutē. Bharati: those who can sing it will forever be sweet as ambrosia to celestials. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: those that zealously chant with no break will unto celestials be delectable like insatiable cream."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil sets the condition of singing daily (vaikal)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.7.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0508Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.8.11: the decad is said to yield being desired, served or embraced by women"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.8.11: Frucht der Dekade: Von Frauen begehrt werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarMatantaiyar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: maḻalai tīra vallār kāmar māṉ ēy nōkkiyarkkē. Bharati: those who sing it flawlessly will be adored by fawn-eyed dames. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: those that thoroughly learn will be liked by the doe-eyed damsels as their lovers dear."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil sets the condition of mastering it until the lisp is gone (maḻalai tīra); Satyamurthi's note turns the damsels into the lord's devotees."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.8.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0509Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.9.11: the decad is said to yield fame and standing among men"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Ruhm und Stand unter den Menschen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPukal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ceppuvār ciṟantār piṟantē. Bharati: those who sing it will excel in this world. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will gain fame and distinction, though born in this land."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.9.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0510Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.10.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 5.10.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār māka vaikuntattu makiḻveytuvar vaikalumē. Bharati: those who can sing it will enjoy high Vaikuntha forever."@en ;
    skos:note "The 1981 translation of this stanza was not located in its text layer; the reading rests on the Tamil and on one translation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 5.10.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0601Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.1.11: the decad is said to yield being desired, served or embraced by women"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.1.11: Frucht der Dekade: Von Frauen begehrt werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarMatantaiyar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: iṉkoḷ pāṭal vallār matanar miṉṉiṭaiyavarkkē. Bharati: will win the hearts of damsels. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will unto the lord be dear like the lovers unto their beloveds."@en ;
    skos:note "The translations divide on whose hearts are won: the damsels' in Bharati, the lord's in Satyamurthi; the Tamil makes the singers Madanas to the slender-waisted."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.1.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0602Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.2.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from want and poverty"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.2.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freiheit von Mangel"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarNalkuravuIlamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: icaiyoṭum nāttaṉṉāl navila uraippārkku illai nalkuravē. Bharati: will end all poverty. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will never from poverty (of God-love) suffer."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil sets the condition of reciting with the tongue to music; Satyamurthi brackets the poverty as poverty of love for God."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.2.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0603Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.3.11: the decad is said to yield standing with the celestials"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.3.11: Frucht der Dekade: Stand bei den Himmlischen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVanavar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār kōṇaiyiṉṟi viṇṇōrkku oṉṟum āvar kuravarkaḷē. Bharati: those who sing it straight will be as Gurus to the gods. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will for unreserved admiration by the celestials become fit."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.3.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0604Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.4.11: the decad is said to yield becoming the lord's devotee"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.4.11: Frucht der Dekade: Zum Verehrer des Herrn werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTamar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: tūya āyirattu ippattāl pattarāvar tuvaḷiṉṟiyē. Bharati: those who sing and dance along are blameless devotees."@en ;
    skos:note "The 1981 translation of this stanza was not located in its text layer; the reading rests on the Tamil and on one translation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.4.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0605Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.5.11: the decad is said to yield service to the lord and his devotees"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.5.11: Frucht der Dekade: Dienst am Herrn und an seinen Verehrern"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAtimai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār aṭimai ceyvār tirumālukkē. Bharati: will secure service to the lord for those who sing it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will service unto him render for ever."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.5.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0606Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.6.11: the decad is said to yield standing with the celestials"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.6.11: Frucht der Dekade: Stand bei den Himmlischen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVanavar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallavar kaṭṭeḻil vāṉavar pōkam uṇpārē. Bharati: gives beautiful radiant celestials' joy. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will on a par with celestials enjoy heavenly bliss par excellence."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.6.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0607Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.7.11: the decad is said to yield rule over earth or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.7.11: Frucht der Dekade: Herrschaft über Erde oder Himmel"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAlutal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: cittam vaittu uraippār tikaḻ poṉ ulaku āḷvārē. Bharati: will secure the rule of golden earth. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will over the eternal land reign."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil sets the condition of reciting with the mind set on it (cittam vaittu); poṉ ulaku is earth to Bharati and the eternal land to Satyamurthi."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.7.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0608Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.8.11: the decad is said to yield the melting of the heart"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.8.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Schmelzen des Herzens"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarUrukutal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār ūṟṟiṉkaṇ nuṇmaṇal pōl urukā niṟpar nīrāyē. Bharati: will make the heart melt like fine sand in water. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will indeed thaw down like unto the sands minute in water springs."@en ;
    skos:note "Satyamurthi's note counts the melting of the heart itself as the benefit."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.8.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0609Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.9.11: the decad is said to yield service to the lord and his devotees"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Dienst am Herrn und an seinen Verehrern"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAtimai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: uriya toṇṭar ākkum ulakam uṇṭāṟkē. Bharati: will secure the feet of the lord who swallowed the earth. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will become the exclusive servants of the lord supreme."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.9.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0610Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.10.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 6.10.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: piṭittār piṭittār vīṟṟiruntu periya vāṉuḷ nilāvuvarē. Bharati: will secure the joy of Vaikuntha forever. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: those that recite or listen will in high heaven for ever remain."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 6.10.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0701Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.1.11: the decad is said to yield the ending of karma"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.1.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Enden des Karma"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVinaiTirtal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: kaṇṭu pāṭavallār viṉai pōm kaṅkulum pakalē. Bharati: will end the karmas of those who sing it night and day. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: gone are the sins of those who sing day and night with understanding fine."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil sets the conditions of singing with insight (kaṇṭu) and by night and by day."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.1.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0702Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.2.11: the decad is said to yield joy and bliss and standing with the celestials"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.2.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freude und Seligkeit und Stand bei den Himmlischen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarInpam, pmc:AlvarVanavar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār imaiyavar cūḻa iruppar pēr iṉpa veḷḷattē. Bharati: will secure a life of joy, hallowed by good celestials. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will be by celestials surrounded in high heaven and immersed in eternal joy remain."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.2.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0703Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.3.11: the decad is said to yield service to the lord and his devotees"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.3.11: Frucht der Dekade: Dienst am Herrn und an seinen Verehrern"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAtimai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ēttavallār avar aṭimait tiṟattu āḻiyārē. Bharati: will secure the golden feet of the discus lord. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will in his eternal service be blessed to remain."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.3.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0704Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.4.11: the decad is said to yield success"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.4.11: Frucht der Dekade: Erfolg"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVenri ;
    skos:note "Tamil: veṉṟi tarum pattum mēvik kaṟpārkkē. Bharati: reciting it with love bestows success. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: success in many ways will these songs confer on those that learn them."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.4.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0705Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.5.11: the decad is said to yield knowledge and clarity of mind"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.5.11: Frucht der Dekade: Wissen und Klarheit des Geistes"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarKalvi ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār avar teḷivuṟṟa cintaiyar. Bharati: will bequeath clear thought to all who recite it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will clarity of mind attain even in this land of dismal distress."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.5.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0706Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.6.11: the decad is said to yield being desired, served or embraced by women"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.6.11: Frucht der Dekade: Von Frauen begehrt werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarMatantaiyar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallāravarai tokkup pallāṇṭu icaittuk kavari ceyvar ēḻaiyarē. Bharati: will secure the whisk and service of fair damsels. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will the high heaven attain and there the damsels bright will adore them and entertain."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.6.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0707Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.7.11: the decad is said to yield standing with the celestials"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.7.11: Frucht der Dekade: Stand bei den Himmlischen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVanavar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār uṭkuṭai vāṉavarōṭu uṭaṉāy eṉṟum māyārē. Bharati: will secure the world of celestials forever. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will for ever remain in the company of ardent celestials in heaven."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.7.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0708Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.8.11: the decad is said to yield joy and bliss"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.8.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freude und Seligkeit"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarInpam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: āmvaṇṇattāl uraippār amaintār tamakku eṉṟaikkumē. Bharati: will make devotees of those who recite it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will for ever enjoy undiminished the bliss divine."@en ;
    skos:note "The translations divide: becoming devotees in Bharati, undiminished bliss in Satyamurthi; the Tamil grants it to those who recite as best they can (āmvaṇṇattāl)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.8.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0709Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.9.11: the decad is said to yield joy and bliss"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freude und Seligkeit"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarInpam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: eṅṅaṉē colliṉum iṉpam payakkumē. Bharati: gives joy, whichever way sung. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will breed joy, in whatever manner sung."@en ;
    skos:note "The one terminal stanza that waives every condition: the joy follows however the decad is sung, and Satyamurthi's note adds, whether with devotion or otherwise."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.9.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0710Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.10.11: the decad is said to yield standing with the celestials"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 7.10.11: Frucht der Dekade: Stand bei den Himmlischen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVanavar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: tēvar vaikal tīrttaṅkaḷē eṉṟu pūcittu nalki uraippār tam tēviyarkkē. Bharati: will secure the worship of celestials and their spouses. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: the celestials in heaven shall ever say unto their spouses that those well-versed in these songs are indeed very pure."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 7.10.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0801Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.1.11: the decad is said to yield release"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.1.11: Frucht der Dekade: Befreiung"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVidu ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ivaṟṟāl uyyalām toṇṭīr. Bharati: by this decad, O devotees, attain liberation. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: salvation we can all attain, reciting these songs."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.1.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0802Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.2.11: the decad is said to yield joy and bliss"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.2.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freude und Seligkeit"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarInpam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: icaiyoṭum vallār ātum ōr tītilarāki iṅkum aṅkum ellām amaivārkaḷ. Bharati: those who can sing it will become faultless and attain everything on earth and in heaven. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will from blemishes of all kinds be absolved and enjoy the best of all good things, here and abroad."@en ;
    skos:note "The Tamil sets the condition of singing to music."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.2.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0803Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.3.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from rebirth"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.3.11: Frucht der Dekade: Nicht wiedergeboren werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPiravaamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: niraiyē vallār nīṭulakattup piṟavārē. Bharati: will secure freedom from rebirth. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: those that learn well will never in this sprawling world be reborn."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.3.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0804Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.4.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven and freedom from rebirth"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.4.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels und Nicht wiedergeboren werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam, pmc:AlvarPiravaamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vāṉiṉ mītu ēṟṟi aruḷceytu muṭikkum piṟavi mā māyak kūttiṉaiyē. Bharati: those who sing will end this drama and attain heaven."@en ;
    skos:note "The 1981 translation of this stanza was not located in its text layer; the reading rests on the Tamil and on one translation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.4.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0805Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.5.11: the decad is said to yield joy and bliss"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.5.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freude und Seligkeit"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarInpam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallārkaḷ iṅkē kāṇa ip piṟappē makiḻvar. Bharati: those who sing it will enjoy bliss here and now. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will right here and now enjoy with no intermission bliss supreme."@en ;
    skos:note "The fruit is placed in this birth and in sight of others (iṅkē kāṇa ip piṟappē)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.5.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0806Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.6.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.6.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: mēlai vaikuntattu iruttum. Bharati: will secure Vaikuntha and elevation of spirit. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will the chanters elevate unto the exalted heaven."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.6.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0807Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.7.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from rebirth"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.7.11: Frucht der Dekade: Nicht wiedergeboren werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPiravaamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: caṉmam viṭa tēyntu aṟa nōkkum. Bharati: will secure his feet cutting rebirth. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will grind to a halt the chanters' cycle of birth and rebirth."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.7.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0808Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.8.11: the decad is said to yield reaching the lord's feet"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.8.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen der Füße des Herrn"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTiruvadi ;
    skos:note "Tamil: aruḷi aṭikkīḻ iruttum. Bharati: secures his lotus feet for those who sing it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: the lord will bless and under his feet retain the chanters."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.8.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0809Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.9.11: the decad is said to yield service to the lord and his devotees"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Dienst am Herrn und an seinen Verehrern"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAtimai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: nērppaṭṭār neṭumāṟku aṭimai ceyyavē. Bharati: will secure the lord's feet for those who recite it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will for his loving service become truly eligible."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.9.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0810Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.10.11: the decad is said to yield service to the lord and his devotees"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 8.10.11: Frucht der Dekade: Dienst am Herrn und an seinen Verehrern"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAtimai ;
    skos:note "Bharati: will secure a happy domestic life for those who sing it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will as householders flourish to serve unremittingly the lord's devotees."@en ;
    skos:note "Read in the two translations. The Project Madurai text numbers this decad 9.9 by mistake, so the Tamil of the stanza was not isolated by its locus; the first stanza of the decad was read in Tamil and agrees with both translations."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 8.10.11 (trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0901Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.1.11: the decad is said to yield fame and standing among men"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.1.11: Frucht der Dekade: Ruhm und Stand unter den Menschen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPukal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ōtavalla pirākkaḷ nammai āḷuṭaiyārkaḷ paṇṭē. Bharati: those who sing it will be our eternal masters. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: the benefactors well-versed in these songs are unto him masters since long back."@en ;
    skos:note "The fruit is a standing: the reciters are masters to the poet himself."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.1.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0902Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.2.11: the decad is said to yield reaching the lord's feet"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.2.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen der Füße des Herrn"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTiruvadi ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallārkaḷ ōvutal iṉṟi ulakam mūṉṟu aḷantāṉ aṭiyiṇai uḷḷattu ōrvārē. Bharati: will secure the feet of the lord when sung. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will for ever meditate upon the feet of the one who did all the three worlds span."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.2.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0903Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.3.11: the decad is said to yield reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.3.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ippattiṉiṉ pālar vaikuntam ēṟutal pāṉmaiyē. Bharati: will secure high Vaikuntha. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: 'tis but natural that those somehow associated with these songs do ascend the high heaven."@en ;
    skos:note "Satyamurthi's 'somehow associated' sets the threshold as low as the Tamil pālar allows."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.3.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0904Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.4.11: the decad is said to yield reaching the lord's feet"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.4.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen der Füße des Herrn"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTiruvadi ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ēṟē tarum vāṉavar taṉ iṉṉuyirkkē. Bharati: grants the lord himself."@en ;
    skos:note "The 1981 translation of this stanza was not located in its text layer; the reading rests on the Tamil and on one translation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.4.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0905Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.5.11: the decad is said to yield the melting of the heart"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.5.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Schmelzen des Herzens"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarUrukutal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: oṉpatōṭu oṉṟukkum mūvulakum urukumē. Bharati: will melt the hearts of all. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: listeners in all three worlds will surely thaw down, however hard-hearted."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.5.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0906Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.6.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from rebirth"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.6.11: Frucht der Dekade: Nicht wiedergeboren werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPiravaamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: caṉmam muṭiveyti nācam kaṇṭīrkaḷ eṅkāṉalē. Bharati: will destroy the mirage-world. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will ensure the destruction of the mirage of saṃsāra and halt the recurrence of birth."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.6.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0907Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.7.11: the decad is said to yield the cure of disease"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.7.11: Frucht der Dekade: Die Heilung von Krankheit"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarNoyAruttal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ippattum nōy aṟukkumē. Bharati: will cure sickness."@en ;
    skos:note "The 1981 translation of this stanza was not located in its text layer; the reading rests on the Tamil and on one translation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.7.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0908Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.8.11: the decad is said to yield rule over earth or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.8.11: Frucht der Dekade: Herrschaft über Erde oder Himmel"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAlutal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār maṇ āṇṭu maṇam kamaḻvar mallikaiyē. Bharati: now sing it and rule the earth. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: shall rule this earth long and then heaven attain, imbibing the fragrance sweet of the lord."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.8.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm0909Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.9.11: the decad is said to yield release"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 9.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Befreiung"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarVidu ;
    skos:note "Tamil: avaṉiyuḷ alaṟṟi niṉṟu uymmiṉ toṇṭīr. Bharati: devotees, sing this well and rule the earth."@en ;
    skos:note "The translations divide and Bharati's rule over the earth is not in the Tamil line, which bids the devotees cry it out on earth and be saved (uymmiṉ); entered on the Tamil."@en ;
    skos:note "The 1981 translation of this stanza was not located in its text layer; the reading rests on the Tamil and on one translation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 9.9.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm1001Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.1.11: the decad is said to yield freedom from affliction"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.1.11: Frucht der Dekade: Freiheit von Leid"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTuyarIlamai ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ēttavallārkku iṭar keṭumē. Bharati: those who can will end their miseries, this is certain. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: the woes shall be gone of those that chant these songs."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 10.1.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm1002Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.2.11: the decad is said to yield being desired, served or embraced by women"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.2.11: Frucht der Dekade: Von Frauen begehrt werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarMatantaiyar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār aṇaivar pōy amarulakil paintoṭi maṭantaiyar tam vēymaru tōḷ iṇaiyē. Bharati: will secure the embrace of soft slender shoulders of well-ornamented women in the celestial world. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: shall attain heaven at the end of the current span and there be entertained by the damsels fine."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 10.2.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm1004Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.4.11: the decad is said to yield reaching the lord's feet"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.4.11: Frucht der Dekade: Das Erreichen der Füße des Herrn"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarTiruvadi ;
    skos:note "Tamil: kaṟṟārkku ōr paṟṟākum kaṇṇaṉ kaḻaliṇaiyē. Bharati: offers shelter at his feet to those who sing it. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: unto those that learn shall be vouchsafed Kaṇṇaṉ's lovely pair of feet."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 10.4.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm1005Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.5.11: the decad is said to yield receiving the lord's grace"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.5.11: Frucht der Dekade: Die Gnade des Herrn empfangen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarArulPeru ;
    skos:note "Tamil: aṭiyārkku aruḷ pēṟē. Bharati: will secure for devotees the grace of the lord. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will put the chanters on a par with him in the lord's spontaneous grace."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 10.5.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm1008Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.8.11: the decad is said to yield rule over earth or heaven and reaching Vaikuṇṭha or heaven"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.8.11: Frucht der Dekade: Herrschaft über Erde oder Himmel und Das Erreichen Vaikuṇṭhas oder des Himmels"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarAlutal, pmc:AlvarVaikuntam ;
    skos:note "Tamil: vallār toṇṭar āḷvatu cūḻ poṉ vicumpē. Bharati: will secure for devotees the radiant Vaikuntha. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will surely hold sway over the glittering heaven."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 10.8.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm1009Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.9.11: the decad is said to yield becoming a sage"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.9.11: Frucht der Dekade: Zum Weisen werden"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarMunivar ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ivai vallār muṉivarē. Bharati: reciting this decad makes a person bard. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: will become sages, steeped in the divine, for ever."@en ;
    skos:note "Bharati's bard renders muṉivar, which Satyamurthi gives as sages."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 10.9.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .

pmc:AlvarTvm1010Payan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.10.11: the decad is said to yield fame and standing among men"@en, "Tiruvāymoḻi 10.10.11: Frucht der Dekade: Ruhm und Stand unter den Menschen"@de ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:AlvarIppattu ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:AlvarPukal ;
    skos:note "Tamil: ippattu aṟintār piṟantār uyarntē. Bharati: those who know this will be born in high. Satyamurthi Ayyangar: exalted among those born are they."@en ;
    skos:note "The condition is knowing the decad (aṟintār)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:Alvar ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:AlvarTiruvaymoli ;
    dcterms:source "Nammāḻvār, Tiruvāymoḻi 10.10.11 (Tamil, Project Madurai ed.; trans. Srirama Bharati and Sowbhagya Lakshmi, Melkote 1987; trans. S. Satyamurthi Ayyangar, Bombay 1981)" .
